OL,3,GNEWSAQuadracycle challenge raises money
OL,4,Afor charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of men have cycled 250 miles
OL,7,F(402km) to raise money and awareness
OL,8,Ffor a brain tumour charity and a
OL,9,Fhospice.
OL,11,FThe team of 10 friends in their 50's
OL,12,Fand 60's have cycled from Chorleywood,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, to Dartmouth, Devon,
OL,14,Fover eight days on a quadracycle to
OL,15,Fraise money for Brain Tumour Research
OL,16,Fand Keech Hospice Care.
OL,18,FThe group said they were inspired to do
OL,19,Fthe Woods to the Waves challenge by
OL,20,F12-year-old Betsy who became blind
OL,21,Fafter a brain tumour at the age of two.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
