OL,3,GNEWSAQuadracycle challenge raises money
OL,4,Afor charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FDean Tanner, who organised the
OL,7,Fchallenge, said he hoped to raise
OL,8,Fawareness because "it's unbelievable
OL,9,Fhow many people are actually affected
OL,10,Fby brain tumours".
